@startuml Non_Functional_Requirements_Component

title SmartFit System Architecture - Non-Functional Requirements

left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor black
    ArrowColor black
}

actor "Customer /\nRetailer" as User

component "Web Frontend\n(React)" as Frontend

component "Backend API\n(FastAPI)" as Backend

component "Authentication\n& Authorization" as Auth

component "Computer Vision\nProcessing" as CV

component "Avatar /\nVisualization" as Visual

database "PostgreSQL\nDatabase" as DB

User --> Frontend

Frontend --> Backend
Backend --> Auth
Backend --> CV
Backend --> Visual
Backend --> DB

CV --> DB
Visual --> DB

note bottom of Frontend
Responsive and user-friendly
web interface
end note

note bottom of Auth
Controlled access and
data protection
end note

note bottom of CV
Reliable processing and
acceptable response time
end note

note bottom of Backend
Modular and scalable
system services
end note

note bottom of DB
Secure and consistent
data storage
end note

@enduml